# Reference screenshots for MAME validation
#
# To update the reference screenshot:
#   1. Build xasm++ and assemble Prince of Persia (see tests/e2e/apple2/prince_of_persia/README.md)
#   2. Run MAME manually until the title screen appears, then press F12 (MAME screenshot)
#   3. Copy the saved PNG from MAME's snap/ directory to this directory as pop_title.png
#   4. Commit pop_title.png
#
# The validation workflow uses ImageMagick PSNR (>= 40 dB) to compare the CI screenshot
# against pop_title.png. A 40 dB threshold tolerates minor rendering variation while
# catching missing or corrupted graphics.
